[issue_comment] langxm1223 | created=2016-08-06T07:33:14Z | updated=2016-08-06T07:33:14Z | https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/5243#issuecomment-238010847
Hello @LorenzMeier , 
Thanks for your reply.
According to the bmp280 data sheet and the sample pressure and temperature conversion code, the temperature conversion must be done before the pressure conversion, as the latter one uses some result from the temperature conversion. This patch only fixed the issue that first some baro reading is wrong. However, during the test, I observed incorrect baro reading every once a while, after it is running for a while. I doubt there is still some issue in the driver framework bmp280 driver.
So I hope that someone could take a deep review of that.
Thank you.


---

